  "duration_s": 402.355011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九七零年冬天，北京中关村街头，一个穿破棉袄的老头弓着背在水果摊前站了足足三分钟，摊上的苹果几毛钱一斤。他伸手摸了摸兜里，最后啥也没买，低着头慢慢走了。旁边有认识他的学生，看不下去了，追上去塞给他几块钱。老头接过钱，两只手指哆嗦，竟然像个做错事的的孩子似的。弯下腰连连道谢，路过的年轻人捂着鼻子绕着走。他们哪知道这个连苹果都舍不得买的老头到底是个什么人物。我跟你说，听完他的故事，你要是心里不堵的话，我跟找我，他叫叶启孙，这名字你可能头一回听，但接下来这些人你肯定熟。杨振宁、李政道、邓稼先、钱学深、钱三强、钱伟长、赵九章、华罗庚、王淦昌。随便拎一个出来，都是写进教科书的大人物。可你知道吗？这帮人全都是叶启孙的学生。中国二十三位两弹一星元勋九位是他一手带出来。他这辈子教出了七十九位院士，说，他是大师中的大师，那是一点没吹，可就是这么一个人，晚年却生活窘迫，在中关村一带徘徊街头，偶尔碰到熟识的学生，才低着头轻声说一句，你有钱给我几个索求不过三五块钱，你说这叫什么事儿？咱们倒回去说，一八九八年叶启孙出生在上海，那年，正好戊戌变法大清朝，风雨飘摇洋人骑在脖子上欺负人。他从小就看在眼里，心里憋着一股劲，中国不能再这么窝囊下去了。嗯，十三岁他考上清华学堂，是清华头一批学生，二十岁，去芝加哥大学读物理，二十二岁进哈佛。二十三岁那年，他在实验室里测出了当时全世界最精确的朗克常数。啥概念？这个数值被国际物理学界整整用了十六年。一个二十三岁的中国年轻人，头一回把中国人的名字写进了世界物理教材。哈佛一看，这是天才啊，高薪实验室终身教职，啥条件都开出来了，可叶启孙呢头也不回，买张船票就回国了。有人问他图啥，他就一句话，中国条件再差，我也要回去，就这一句话，今天多少人听了不脸红。一九二五年，二十七岁的叶启孙到了清华，一个人扛起了物理系。当时啥情况全系就他一个教授，所有课，全是他上本科生加起来才七个人，没有仪器，自己做，没有设备，自己拼没有经费，从自己工资里掏，就这么着。他硬生生把清华物理系带成了全中国最好的物理系。三十一岁，又创建了理学院，一口气办了算学物理化学生物，心里地穴六个系清华，从此逆袭成全国顶尖学府。叶启孙最牛的本事不是自己搞研究，是发现人才。那双眼睛跟探照灯似的，谁是块料，一眼就能看出来。华罗庚杂货铺、伙计、初中学历，所有人都反对招蹋。只有叶启孙力排众议，把他弄进清华，后来又送他去剑桥。再后来，华罗庚成了中国数学界的泰斗，钱伟长考清华物理只考了五分，数理化加一块才二十五分，换别人早拒了。叶启孙偏偏破歌收了，后来钱伟长成了中国力学之父，李政道性格太冲，差点被开除。叶启孙一路护着自己掏工资，资助他去美国，后来李政道三十一岁，拿了诺贝尔奖领奖时说。叶启孙老师改变了我一生的命运。钱学森补习时没地方住，叶启孙直接让他住自己家里，还引导他从铁道转向航空。后来的事儿大伙都知道了，钱学森成了中国航天之父。还有王淦昌参加学生运动，差点出事。叶启孙把他叫到跟前，声泪俱下的问，谁让你去的？你明白自己的使命吗？王淦昌当场就哭了一辈子。记着这句话，后来成了中国核弹之父。你看看这哪是教书，这是拿自己的命在托人啊，可偏偏就是这么一个好人，后来的遭遇说出来你都不敢信。一九三七年，抗战全面爆发，叶启孙有个最得意的学生叫熊大枕。这学生主动请缨，要去前线研究炸药打鬼，子叶启孙舍不得。但还是支持他去了师徒。二人隔着战线和合作，研制出了烈性炸药地雷和无线电设备。后来著名的地道战地雷战里面就有他们的心血。可谁也没想到，熊大枕这一去竟然成了叶启孙一生噩梦的开始。看到这儿，你是不是已经气的手都在抖了？先别划走，下集更揪心。觉得这段历史该让更多人知道的，先点个赞，点个收藏，再转发给身边的亲戚朋友。没关注的，赶紧点个关注，下集马上更，我带你看看叶启孙后半辈子到底受了多少罪，看完你绝对忘不了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1650,
      "text": "一九七零年冬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2110,
      "end_ms": 4110,
      "text": "北京中关村街头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4650,
      "end_ms": 11110,
      "text": "一个穿破棉袄的老头弓着背在水果摊前站了足足三分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11890,
      "end_ms": 13990,
      "text": "摊上的苹果几毛钱一斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14550,
      "end_ms": 16090,
      "text": "他伸手摸了摸兜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16270,
      "end_ms": 17330,
      "text": "最后啥也没买，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17470,
      "end_ms": 18710,
      "text": "低着头慢慢走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19510,
      "end_ms": 21010,
      "text": "旁边有认识他的学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21010,
      "end_ms": 21890,
      "text": "看不下去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22530,
      "end_ms": 24150,
      "text": "追上去塞给他几块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25470,
      "end_ms": 26490,
      "text": "老头接过钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27050,
      "end_ms": 28290,
      "text": "两只手指哆嗦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28630,
      "end_ms": 31060,
      "text": "竟然像个做错事的的孩子似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31340,
      "end_ms": 33280,
      "text": "弯下腰连连道谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33980,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "路过的年轻人捂着鼻子绕着走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36560,
      "end_ms": 42200,
      "text": "他们哪知道这个连苹果都舍不得买的老头到底是个什么人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43040,
      "end_ms": 43820,
      "text": "我跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00018",
      "start_ms": 44660,
      "end_ms": 45840,
      "text": "听完他的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46080,
      "end_ms": 47640,
      "text": "你要是心里不堵的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "我跟找我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49680,
      "end_ms": 51120,
      "text": "他叫叶启孙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51900,
      "end_ms": 53560,
      "text": "这名字你可能头一回听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53820,
      "end_ms": 56080,
      "text": "但接下来这些人你肯定熟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00024",
      "start_ms": 56640,
      "end_ms": 65410,
      "text": "杨振宁、李政道、邓稼先、钱学深、钱三强、钱伟长、赵九章、华罗庚、王淦昌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65710,
      "end_ms": 67190,
      "text": "随便拎一个出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67290,
      "end_ms": 69455,
      "text": "都是写进教科书的大人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70590,
      "end_ms": 71450,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71490,
      "end_ms": 73995,
      "text": "这帮人全都是叶启孙的学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74400,
      "end_ms": 80405,
      "text": "中国二十三位两弹一星元勋九位是他一手带出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80970,
      "end_ms": 83445,
      "text": "他这辈子教出了七十九位院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83900,
      "end_ms": 84040,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84040,
      "end_ms": 86275,
      "text": "他是大师中的大师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00033",
      "start_ms": 86630,
      "end_ms": 87945,
      "text": "那是一点没吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00034",
      "start_ms": 88420,
      "end_ms": 89565,
      "text": "可就是这么一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90000,
      "end_ms": 91975,
      "text": "晚年却生活窘迫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92390,
      "end_ms": 95065,
      "text": "在中关村一带徘徊街头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95680,
      "end_ms": 98180,
      "text": "偶尔碰到熟识的学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98560,
      "end_ms": 100565,
      "text": "才低着头轻声说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101050,
      "end_ms": 104485,
      "text": "你有钱给我几个索求不过三五块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105210,
      "end_ms": 106490,
      "text": "你说这叫什么事儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106490,
      "end_ms": 107785,
      "text": "咱们倒回去说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00042",
      "start_ms": 109960,
      "end_ms": 112545,
      "text": "一八九八年叶启孙出生在上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113490,
      "end_ms": 113910,
      "text": "那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00044",
      "start_ms": 113930,
      "end_ms": 116990,
      "text": "正好戊戌变法大清朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117070,
      "end_ms": 120565,
      "text": "风雨飘摇洋人骑在脖子上欺负人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121550,
      "end_ms": 123395,
      "text": "他从小就看在眼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00047",
      "start_ms": 123830,
      "end_ms": 125175,
      "text": "心里憋着一股劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126100,
      "end_ms": 128525,
      "text": "中国不能再这么窝囊下去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128770,
      "end_ms": 129010,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00050",
      "start_ms": 129400,
      "end_ms": 133255,
      "text": "十三岁他考上清华学堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00051",
      "start_ms": 133950,
      "end_ms": 136125,
      "text": "是清华头一批学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136910,
      "end_ms": 137690,
      "text": "二十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00053",
      "start_ms": 137930,
      "end_ms": 140265,
      "text": "去芝加哥大学读物理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00054",
      "start_ms": 140780,
      "end_ms": 142200,
      "text": "二十二岁进哈佛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00055",
      "start_ms": 142600,
      "end_ms": 143860,
      "text": "二十三岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00056",
      "start_ms": 144280,
      "end_ms": 150690,
      "text": "他在实验室里测出了当时全世界最精确的朗克常数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00057",
      "start_ms": 150830,
      "end_ms": 151545,
      "text": "啥概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00058",
      "start_ms": 152590,
      "end_ms": 156785,
      "text": "这个数值被国际物理学界整整用了十六年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00059",
      "start_ms": 157810,
      "end_ms": 160465,
      "text": "一个二十三岁的中国年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00060",
      "start_ms": 160920,
      "end_ms": 165195,
      "text": "头一回把中国人的名字写进了世界物理教材。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00061",
      "start_ms": 165840,
      "end_ms": 166620,
      "text": "哈佛一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00062",
      "start_ms": 166620,
      "end_ms": 167715,
      "text": "这是天才啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00063",
      "start_ms": 167930,
      "end_ms": 170890,
      "text": "高薪实验室终身教职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00064",
      "start_ms": 171190,
      "end_ms": 172675,
      "text": "啥条件都开出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00065",
      "start_ms": 173550,
      "end_ms": 175655,
      "text": "可叶启孙呢头也不回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00066",
      "start_ms": 176170,
      "end_ms": 177805,
      "text": "买张船票就回国了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00067",
      "start_ms": 178160,
      "end_ms": 179325,
      "text": "有人问他图啥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179780,
      "end_ms": 180705,
      "text": "他就一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00069",
      "start_ms": 181400,
      "end_ms": 182915,
      "text": "中国条件再差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00070",
      "start_ms": 183450,
      "end_ms": 184515,
      "text": "我也要回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00071",
      "start_ms": 185510,
      "end_ms": 186505,
      "text": "就这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00072",
      "start_ms": 187340,
      "end_ms": 189755,
      "text": "今天多少人听了不脸红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00073",
      "start_ms": 190110,
      "end_ms": 191055,
      "text": "一九二五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00074",
      "start_ms": 191380,
      "end_ms": 193845,
      "text": "二十七岁的叶启孙到了清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00075",
      "start_ms": 194340,
      "end_ms": 195955,
      "text": "一个人扛起了物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00076",
      "start_ms": 196420,
      "end_ms": 199705,
      "text": "当时啥情况全系就他一个教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00077",
      "start_ms": 200190,
      "end_ms": 200850,
      "text": "所有课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00078",
      "start_ms": 200930,
      "end_ms": 204775,
      "text": "全是他上本科生加起来才七个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00079",
      "start_ms": 205450,
      "end_ms": 206250,
      "text": "没有仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00080",
      "start_ms": 206250,
      "end_ms": 206830,
      "text": "自己做，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00081",
      "start_ms": 207130,
      "end_ms": 208010,
      "text": "没有设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00082",
      "start_ms": 208010,
      "end_ms": 209940,
      "text": "自己拼没有经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00083",
      "start_ms": 210020,
      "end_ms": 211635,
      "text": "从自己工资里掏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00084",
      "start_ms": 212140,
      "end_ms": 212925,
      "text": "就这么着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00085",
      "start_ms": 213210,
      "end_ms": 218035,
      "text": "他硬生生把清华物理系带成了全中国最好的物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00086",
      "start_ms": 218530,
      "end_ms": 219410,
      "text": "三十一岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00087",
      "start_ms": 219630,
      "end_ms": 221255,
      "text": "又创建了理学院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00088",
      "start_ms": 221770,
      "end_ms": 226780,
      "text": "一口气办了算学物理化学生物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00089",
      "start_ms": 227090,
      "end_ms": 229610,
      "text": "心里地穴六个系清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229690,
      "end_ms": 232395,
      "text": "从此逆袭成全国顶尖学府。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00091",
      "start_ms": 233010,
      "end_ms": 236130,
      "text": "叶启孙最牛的本事不是自己搞研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00092",
      "start_ms": 236430,
      "end_ms": 237755,
      "text": "是发现人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00093",
      "start_ms": 238340,
      "end_ms": 240495,
      "text": "那双眼睛跟探照灯似的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00094",
      "start_ms": 240900,
      "end_ms": 241845,
      "text": "谁是块料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00095",
      "start_ms": 242130,
      "end_ms": 243405,
      "text": "一眼就能看出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00096",
      "start_ms": 243820,
      "end_ms": 246980,
      "text": "华罗庚杂货铺、伙计、初中学历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00097",
      "start_ms": 247180,
      "end_ms": 248825,
      "text": "所有人都反对招蹋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00098",
      "start_ms": 249110,
      "end_ms": 251490,
      "text": "只有叶启孙力排众议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00099",
      "start_ms": 251590,
      "end_ms": 252785,
      "text": "把他弄进清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00100",
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 255325,
      "text": "后来又送他去剑桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00101",
      "start_ms": 256280,
      "end_ms": 257060,
      "text": "再后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00102",
      "start_ms": 257380,
      "end_ms": 260235,
      "text": "华罗庚成了中国数学界的泰斗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00103",
      "start_ms": 261170,
      "end_ms": 264190,
      "text": "钱伟长考清华物理只考了五分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00104",
      "start_ms": 264370,
      "end_ms": 266365,
      "text": "数理化加一块才二十五分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00105",
      "start_ms": 266750,
      "end_ms": 267975,
      "text": "换别人早拒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00106",
      "start_ms": 268520,
      "end_ms": 270415,
      "text": "叶启孙偏偏破歌收了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00107",
      "start_ms": 271270,
      "end_ms": 273790,
      "text": "后来钱伟长成了中国力学之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00108",
      "start_ms": 274030,
      "end_ms": 276740,
      "text": "李政道性格太冲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00109",
      "start_ms": 277020,
      "end_ms": 278080,
      "text": "差点被开除。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00110",
      "start_ms": 278600,
      "end_ms": 282320,
      "text": "叶启孙一路护着自己掏工资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00111",
      "start_ms": 282560,
      "end_ms": 283835,
      "text": "资助他去美国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00112",
      "start_ms": 284540,
      "end_ms": 286060,
      "text": "后来李政道三十一岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00113",
      "start_ms": 286060,
      "end_ms": 288060,
      "text": "拿了诺贝尔奖领奖时说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00114",
      "start_ms": 288580,
      "end_ms": 290915,
      "text": "叶启孙老师改变了我一生的命运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00115",
      "start_ms": 291430,
      "end_ms": 293790,
      "text": "钱学森补习时没地方住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00116",
      "start_ms": 294190,
      "end_ms": 296670,
      "text": "叶启孙直接让他住自己家里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00117",
      "start_ms": 296670,
      "end_ms": 299835,
      "text": "还引导他从铁道转向航空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00118",
      "start_ms": 300550,
      "end_ms": 302765,
      "text": "后来的事儿大伙都知道了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00119",
      "start_ms": 303120,
      "end_ms": 305855,
      "text": "钱学森成了中国航天之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00120",
      "start_ms": 306650,
      "end_ms": 309490,
      "text": "还有王淦昌参加学生运动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00121",
      "start_ms": 309590,
      "end_ms": 310330,
      "text": "差点出事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00122",
      "start_ms": 311190,
      "end_ms": 312830,
      "text": "叶启孙把他叫到跟前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00123",
      "start_ms": 313430,
      "end_ms": 314630,
      "text": "声泪俱下的问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00124",
      "start_ms": 314910,
      "end_ms": 315990,
      "text": "谁让你去的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00125",
      "start_ms": 317130,
      "end_ms": 318990,
      "text": "你明白自己的使命吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00126",
      "start_ms": 319370,
      "end_ms": 322370,
      "text": "王淦昌当场就哭了一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00127",
      "start_ms": 322370,
      "end_ms": 323230,
      "text": "记着这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00128",
      "start_ms": 323570,
      "end_ms": 326075,
      "text": "后来成了中国核弹之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00129",
      "start_ms": 328010,
      "end_ms": 330050,
      "text": "你看看这哪是教书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00130",
      "start_ms": 331070,
      "end_ms": 333590,
      "text": "这是拿自己的命在托人啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00131",
      "start_ms": 334550,
      "end_ms": 336590,
      "text": "可偏偏就是这么一个好人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00132",
      "start_ms": 336710,
      "end_ms": 339510,
      "text": "后来的遭遇说出来你都不敢信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00133",
      "start_ms": 339990,
      "end_ms": 341070,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00134",
      "start_ms": 341250,
      "end_ms": 342690,
      "text": "抗战全面爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00135",
      "start_ms": 343070,
      "end_ms": 346510,
      "text": "叶启孙有个最得意的学生叫熊大枕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00136",
      "start_ms": 347050,
      "end_ms": 348670,
      "text": "这学生主动请缨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00137",
      "start_ms": 348970,
      "end_ms": 351890,
      "text": "要去前线研究炸药打鬼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00138",
      "start_ms": 351890,
      "end_ms": 353630,
      "text": "子叶启孙舍不得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00139",
      "start_ms": 353710,
      "end_ms": 356590,
      "text": "但还是支持他去了师徒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00140",
      "start_ms": 356590,
      "end_ms": 358260,
      "text": "二人隔着战线和合作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00141",
      "start_ms": 358660,
      "end_ms": 362720,
      "text": "研制出了烈性炸药地雷和无线电设备。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00142",
      "start_ms": 363620,
      "end_ms": 368915,
      "text": "后来著名的地道战地雷战里面就有他们的心血。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00143",
      "start_ms": 369820,
      "end_ms": 371185,
      "text": "可谁也没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00144",
      "start_ms": 371580,
      "end_ms": 375915,
      "text": "熊大枕这一去竟然成了叶启孙一生噩梦的开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00145",
      "start_ms": 376440,
      "end_ms": 377185,
      "text": "看到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00146",
      "start_ms": 377410,
      "end_ms": 379565,
      "text": "你是不是已经气的手都在抖了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00147",
      "start_ms": 379830,
      "end_ms": 380610,
      "text": "先别划走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00148",
      "start_ms": 380790,
      "end_ms": 381915,
      "text": "下集更揪心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00149",
      "start_ms": 382320,
      "end_ms": 385465,
      "text": "觉得这段历史该让更多人知道的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00150",
      "start_ms": 385950,
      "end_ms": 386715,
      "text": "先点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00151",
      "start_ms": 387490,
      "end_ms": 388505,
      "text": "点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00152",
      "start_ms": 389330,
      "end_ms": 392195,
      "text": "再转发给身边的亲戚朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00153",
      "start_ms": 393100,
      "end_ms": 393900,
      "text": "没关注的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00154",
      "start_ms": 393940,
      "end_ms": 395000,
      "text": "赶紧点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00155",
      "start_ms": 395240,
      "end_ms": 396355,
      "text": "下集马上更，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00156",
      "start_ms": 396850,
      "end_ms": 400375,
      "text": "我带你看看叶启孙后半辈子到底受了多少罪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1108c2ede33e9394_s00157",
      "start_ms": 400800,
      "end_ms": 402275,
      "text": "看完你绝对忘不了。"
    }
  ],
